{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/o7ed6t","slideIndex":0,"text":"Content source: 具有温度可视化功能的层状异质热致变色复合膜及其自适应热管理.docx. Layout reference: ITMC-fmt.pptx, slide 1. Figures are unaltered original experimental figures, apart from explicitly selected panels and white alpha flattening. FPCM metrics refer to the storage layer. The 200-cycle ΔE result refers to TC-RGY50, not TC-RGY20. Outdoor temperature differences are relative to the bare-copper reference. Authors, affiliation and contact were not supplied in the manuscript and remain editable placeholders."}